            %h6#proof_2 Proof
            %p
              First to see that it is an open subset. It is sufficient to show that for any
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi e
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi E
