            %li#Jerzak
              %p
                Ethan Jerzak,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "http://www.math.uchicago.edu/~may/VIGRE/VIGRE2008/REUPapers/Jerzak.pdf"} Fundamental groups and covering spaces
          %p Some of the problems of generalising covering spaces to deal with wild spaces are dealt with in:
          %ul
            %li#Brazas12
              Jeremy Brazas,
              = succeed "," do
                %em Semicoverings
          %p
